Input: {"question": "What position does Simon Hernesby currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 86, "text": "Pope Appoints Simon Hernesby as New Archbishop of Santiago de Chile"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 88, "end": 271, "text": "Vatican City, Rome - In a surprise move, Pope Francis has appointed Simon Hernesby as the new Archbishop of the Roman Catholic Archdiocese of Santiago de Chile, effective immediately."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 272, "end": 403, "text": "The announcement was made earlier today at a press conference in the Vatican, sending shockwaves throughout the Catholic community."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 404, "end": 569, "text": "Hernesby, a respected bishop within the Roman Catholic Church, has been a vocal advocate for social justice and has worked tirelessly to promote interfaith dialogue."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 570, "end": 741, "text": "His appointment marks a significant shift in the Church's leadership in Chile, where the Catholic community has been grappling with issues of inequality and social unrest."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 742, "end": 858, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and honored by this appointment,\" Hernesby said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 859, "end": 1010, "text": "\"I look forward to working with the people of Santiago de Chile to build a more just and compassionate society, guided by the principles of our faith.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1011, "end": 1110, "text": "Hernesby's appointment has been met with widespread approval from Catholic leaders and laity alike."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1111, "end": 1269, "text": "\"Simon is a true servant of the Lord, with a heart for the poor and the marginalized,\" said Cardinal Jorge Medina, a close friend and colleague of Hernesby's."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1270, "end": 1404, "text": "\"He will be a beacon of hope for the people of Santiago de Chile, and a shining example of the Church's commitment to social justice.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1405, "end": 1552, "text": "According to data released by the Vatican, Hernesby's appointment is part of a broader effort to revitalize the Church's presence in Latin America."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1553, "end": 1730, "text": "The region has seen a significant decline in Catholic affiliation in recent years, with many young people turning to evangelical Protestantism or abandoning religion altogether."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1731, "end": 1882, "text": "\"Simon's appointment is a clear signal that the Church is committed to listening to the concerns of the people and responding to their needs,\" said Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1883, "end": 1949, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, a leading expert on Catholicism in Latin America."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1950, "end": 2096, "text": "\"He has a deep understanding of the complexities of Chilean society, and I have no doubt that he will be a powerful force for good in the region.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2097, "end": 2283, "text": "Hernesby's installation ceremony is scheduled to take place on March 25th at the Cathedral of Santiago de Chile, and is expected to draw thousands of worshippers from across the country."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2284, "end": 2453, "text": "As the new Archbishop of Santiago de Chile, Hernesby will oversee a diocese of over 5 million Catholics, making it one of the largest and most influential in the region."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 120, "text": "In the quaint town of Ashwood, nestled in the rolling hills of the countryside, a sense of tranquility pervaded the air."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 121, "end": 324, "text": "It was a place where tradition and faith were woven into the very fabric of daily life, and at the heart of it all stood the majestic Ashwood Cathedral, a testament to the town's rich spiritual heritage."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 325, "end": 502, "text": "Within its ancient walls, a man of great devotion and leadership had taken up the mantle of guiding his flock – Simon Hernesby, the diocesan bishop of the Roman Catholic Church."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 503, "end": 670, "text": "As the sun rose over the cathedral's towering spires, Bishop Hernesby began his day, just as he had for many years, with a quiet moment of contemplation in the chapel."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 671, "end": 848, "text": "His eyes, filled with a deep sense of compassion, gazed upon the intricate stone carvings that adorned the walls, each one telling a story of the saints who had come before him."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 849, "end": 975, "text": "It was in these moments of solitude that he sought guidance, wisdom, and strength to lead his diocese with humility and grace."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 976, "end": 1093, "text": "The evidence of Bishop Hernesby's position as diocesan bishop was evident in the very fabric of the cathedral itself."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1094, "end": 1249, "text": "The ornate bishop's throne, adorned with the symbols of his office, stood proudly at the head of the nave, a testament to his authority and responsibility."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1250, "end": 1403, "text": "The intricate carvings on the throne, depicting scenes from the Bible, served as a reminder of the bishop's role as a teacher and shepherd to his people."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1404, "end": 1527, "text": "As the bishop made his way through the cathedral, he was greeted by the familiar faces of his clergy and the devoted laity."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1528, "end": 1649, "text": "They nodded in respect, acknowledging his leadership and guidance, which had brought stability and growth to the diocese."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1650, "end": 1787, "text": "The bishop's presence was a reassuring one, a symbol of continuity and tradition in a world that often seemed to be changing too quickly."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1788, "end": 1987, "text": "One of the most telling indicators of Bishop Hernesby's position as diocesan bishop was the seal of his office, which adorned the official documents and correspondence that flowed from the cathedral."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1988, "end": 2145, "text": "The seal, bearing the image of the cathedral and the bishop's coat of arms, was a symbol of his authority and authenticity, recognized throughout the Church."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2146, "end": 2334, "text": "In the days that followed, Bishop Hernesby's duties took him to the farthest reaches of his diocese, where he visited parishes, celebrated Mass, and listened to the concerns of his people."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2335, "end": 2406, "text": "He was a bishop who was deeply connected to his flock, and they to him."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "diocesan bishop of the Roman Catholic Church", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Simon Hernesby", "scope": "currently", "claim": "Simon Hernesby currently holds the position of diocesan bishop of the Roman Catholic Church.", "answer": "diocesan bishop of the Roman Catholic Church", "quote": "Within its ancient walls, a man of great devotion and leadership had taken up the mantle of guiding his flock – Simon Hernesby, the diocesan bishop of the Roman Catholic Church.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["diocesan bishop of the Roman Catholic Church", "Archbishop of Santiago de Chile"]}
